If you think you’d like to learn more about&nbsp;
gamedev from an experienced graphics engineer,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:21:59.920 --> 00:22:05.000
I have a variety of courses available, very&nbsp;
suitable for beginners, so if you find yourself&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:22:05.000 --> 00:22:10.360
wanting to get a bit better at gamedev and delve&nbsp;
a little deeper on some subjects, check them out.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:22:10.360 --> 00:22:15.200
Otherwise, if you’d still like to support&nbsp;
me and help choose what topic I cover next,&nbsp;&nbsp;

